Package: com.aimassist.tweak
Name: AimAssist
Version: 5.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Universal aim assist + ESP overlay for games. Touch-smoothing aim assist (ESP-driven, head lock), screen-scan based enemy detection, skeleton/box/health ESP. No substrate dependency — works on jailbreak (Dopamine) and iGameGod sideload.
Maintainer: AimAssist
Author: AimAssist
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
Tag: purpose=extension
